  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cultural Heritage Phase -II - CCHP Bethlehem</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kulturarv-program fas - II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Program f&#xF6;r bevarande av palestinskt kulturarv, restaurering av historiska milj&#xF6;er med arbetsintensiva metoder, gerarbetstillf&#xE4;llen och tillg&#xE5;ng till utrymmen f&#xF6;r allm&#xE4;nnyttiga sociala  aktiviteter.Genomf&#xF6;rs av fyra organisationer(Riwaq i Ramalllah, CCHP i Betlehem, Hebron Rehabilitation Committee och Welfare Association i Jerusalem) i partnerskap med lokala NGOs och myndigheter</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme for restoration of cultural heritage for adaptive reuse, thereby saving valuable historical environments, creating employment and enabling space for community activities. Implemented by four Palestinian organisationa (Riwaq in Ramallah, CCHP in Bethlehem, Hebron Rehabilitatin committee and Welfare Association Old City of Jerusalem Programme) in partnership with local communities</narrative>
  </description>
